Fixed all three review findings:

- Keyed published module functions by module binding, with fresh bindings for redeclarations and name→binding resolution for imports (`src/lsp.rs:535`, `src/lsp.rs:1286`).
- Removed stale function entries when a module-level `set`/`constant` shadows them (`src/lsp.rs:1808`).
- Resolved bare `Module.name` reads through the same published-function table as calls (`src/lsp.rs:2196`).

Added four regression tests in `tests/tooling_grammar_test.rs` and updated the phase report.

Gates re-run:
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` — pass
- `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` — pass
- `cargo test --all-targets` — 2864 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored
- `../rbops/verify.sh "phase-075"` — VERIFY PASS
